/// Effect reference trait.
///
/// Fe models effects as implicit "provider" generic parameters, and a
/// provider is a place. The `EffectRef<T>` marker trait expresses that a
/// provider type can satisfy an effect whose domain is `T`; whether the
/// effect may be written is checked at the term level. A raw pointer's
/// target, `*p`, is a place like any other.

/// Marker: `Self` can satisfy an effect whose domain is `Target`.
pub trait EffectRef<Target> {}

impl<T> EffectRef<T> for T {}
